   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Où» (place and time)",
     "texto": [
      "**Où** = where or in which: **C'est le restaurant où nous mangeons** (it's the restaurant where we eat).",
      "It is also used for time: **C'est le moment où tout le monde mange** (it's the time when everyone eats)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Dont» (of whom, of which)",
     "texto": [
      "**Dont** replaces **de** + noun: **C'est le film dont tout le monde parle** (it's the film everyone is talking about).",
      "With «parler de», use **dont**; nothing else needs adding: you say **dont**, not **de que**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
